      "claim": "The required answer must satisfy two conditions: (i) it is an objective, verifiable fact about the world, and (ii) every mother knows it to be true.",
      "evidence": "The problem asks for “a fact about the world that all mothers know is true,” which implies both factual correctness and universal awareness.",
